    <string name="about_title">About MarkUltra</string>
    <string name="about_body">MarkUltra is a lightweight Markdown editor and viewer built for speed on modest hardware.\n\n• No network permission, no analytics\n• Custom Markdown engine — no WebView, no reflection\n• Full GitHub-flavoured Markdown with tables, tasks and footnotes\n• Works entirely offline</string>
